<title>USA: Wall Street stocks rise at open.</title>
<headline>Wall Street stocks rise at open.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks followed through on yesterday's strength to open higher on Thursday, but analysts said they expected thin trading ahead of the Easter weekend.</p>
<p>--Dow Industrials .DJI up eight at 6888.</p>
<p>--Nasdaq Composite .IXIC up six at 1276.</p>
<p>--S&amp;P Index .SPX up one at 792.</p>
<p>--NYSE advance/decline .AD.N 281/142</p>
<p>--Nasdaq advance/decline .AD.O 781/422</p>
<p>--The 30-year long bond off 1/32 to yield 6.98 pct.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1737</p>
</text>
